-7493277632efc144fd31","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-a638d9784fc427a6f989","layer":"pei","quote":"曹肇弟纂为大将军司马。燕王颇失指，肇出，纂见，惊曰：‘上不安，云何悉共出？宜还！’已暮，放、资宣诏宫门：“不得复纳肇等，罢燕王。”肇明日至门，不得入；惧，诣廷尉，以处事失宜免。帝谓献曰：‘吾已差，便出。’献流涕而出，亦免","attribution":"裴注·《世语》","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":533,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-f69dd3b4e827e95f0087","start":194,"end":304},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o047a-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-aefa69f5bcccfaca207f","layer":"original","quote":"初，文帝分休户三百，封肇弟纂为列侯；后为殄吴将军〖16〗。薨，追赠前将军。﹝四﹞","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o047","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-aefa69f5bcccfaca207f","layer":"original","quote":"初，文帝分休户三百，封肇弟纂为列侯；后为殄吴将军〖16〗。薨，追赠前将军。﹝四﹞","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":194,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":40}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
